msgid ""
"Determines whether Ghostscript should be allowed to use platform fonts, if "
"false only usage of fonts embedded in the document will be allowed."
msgstr ""
"Determina si Ghostscript debería tener permisu pa usar fontes de la"
" plataforma, "
"sinón namái se tendrá permisu pa usar les fontes empotraes nel documentu."

